# Patchwork Beastie with delirium (CR 702.138a): in Bot1's turn-3 upkeep Bot1 accepts "you may mill a card" and an Island goes
# to its graveyard (a land); Lightning Bolt (an instant) and Haywire Mite, sacrificed to exile Bot2's Mox Sapphire (an artifact
# creature), make four card types. Now the Beastie may attack, and does: Bot2 takes 3 from the Bolt and 3 from the Beastie.

